<title>USA: Garrett Cty, Md., won by Legg Mason Wood Walker.</title>
<headline>Garrett Cty, Md., won by Legg Mason Wood Walker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker said it won $4.275 million of Garrett Cty, Md., hospital refunding bonds of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.03 percent.</p>
</text>
